<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY LEAGUE-AUSTRALIAN RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-AUSTRALIAN RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Australian</p>
<p>premiership rugby league matches played at the weekend.</p>
<p>Played Sunday:</p>
<p> North Sydney	41  Manly	  8</p>
<p>Played Saturday:</p>
<p> South Queensland   6  Newcastle   24</p>
<p>Played Friday:</p>
<p> Sydney City	  6  Parramatta  18</p>
<p>Premiership standings (played, won, drawn, lost, points</p>
<p>for, points against, total points):</p>
<p> Manly		 14    9    2    3   306   242    20</p>
<p> North Sydney	14    9    1    4   339   198    19</p>
<p> Parramatta	  14    9    0    5   270   217    18</p>
<p> Newcastle	   13    8    0    5   266   198    16</p>
<p> Gold Coast	  14    7    1    6   279   272    15</p>
<p> Sydney City	 14    7    0    7   292   241    14</p>
<p> Western Suburbs   14    7    0    7   212   215    14</p>
<p> Illawarra	   14    5    3    6   246   234    13</p>
